{"matched":55,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0544a01","n":"0544a","t":"時見如是娑婆界此乃是彼佛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0544b01","n":"0544b","t":"若彼等無邊有情界解脫與彼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0544c01","n":"0544c","t":"所施大小如蚊蚋亦獲快樂得"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0545a01","n":"0545a","t":"洗浴如來無垢身我當讚詠獻"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0545b01","n":"0545b","t":"履用皮少分隨行處處覆外我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0545c01","n":"0545c","t":"煩惱眾盜賊魔著故得便由魔"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0546a01","n":"0546a","t":"一向修自心當起如是見如是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0546b01","n":"0546b","t":"念念須臾間多時為最勝如是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0546c01","n":"0546c","t":"輕手擊他門諦信恒自執如盜"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0547a01","n":"0547a","t":"捨非須盡命彼捨要平等悲心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0547b01","n":"0547b","t":"恒作如是行彼福無有量無始"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0547c01","n":"0547c","t":"不得貪快樂守意令平等心有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0548a01","n":"0548a","t":"割身自見血怕怖而驚倒智者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0548b01","n":"0548b","t":"是故見冤家想作善知識因行"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0548c01","n":"0548c","t":"設令入地獄不由他所作欲盡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0549a01","n":"0549a","t":"無得讚於瞋破壞有情故如是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0549b01","n":"0549b","t":"得彼如是讚云何而不喜彼既"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0549c01","n":"0549c","t":"自利行不圓智者應須覺後後"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0550a01","n":"0550a","t":"障礙出家故是不得出家世間"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0550b01","n":"0550b","t":"破壞身入無間獄若彼作已我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0550c01","n":"0550c","t":"富貴作輪王斯皆從忍得菩提"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0551a01","n":"0551a","t":"入於大苦河復不得人身除樂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0551b01","n":"0551b","t":"求盡過去罪深利他福海此力"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0551c01","n":"0551c","t":"而感彼彼報獲得苦器侵月藏"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0552a01","n":"0552a","t":"有情離我人而彼得最上不降"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0552b01","n":"0552b","t":"念劍失亦然地獄而在心世間"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0552c01","n":"0552c","t":"利益行可愛愛不離世間智者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0553a01","n":"0553a","t":"恒得於多人讚歎而敬愛若迷"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0553b01","n":"0553b","t":"觀察於此身性與身相離性然"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0553c01","n":"0553c","t":"彼今所食噉妬忌何不護飛鷲"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0554a01","n":"0554a","t":"不淨而不一而汝自不嫌無別"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0554b01","n":"0554b","t":"迷者為欲誑恃我感奴僕斷欲"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0554c01","n":"0554c","t":"先當如是觀重自他不二我自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0555a01","n":"0555a","t":"是故妙人月說彼有情句善者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0555b01","n":"0555b","t":"水陸與飛空勿令人住殺由若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0555c01","n":"0555c","t":"以彼自他受是故而取喻汝今"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0556a01","n":"0556a","t":"下劣心我慢自勝嫌人同誇智"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0556b01","n":"0556b","t":"彼緊迅若此必苦惱自退此修"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0556c01","n":"0556c","t":"為此不實身虛受於苦惱何更"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0557a01","n":"0557a","t":"害及勝害等乃世相應事彼二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0557b01","n":"0557b","t":"自性由若斯復喻如燈光破闇"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0557c01","n":"0557c","t":"彼性而無得亦復不能見彼性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0558a01","n":"0558a","t":"安住有著心是得名處處若心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0558b01","n":"0558b","t":"若受於色聲而色復何受如彼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0558c01","n":"0558c","t":"彼事心不迴觀空為最上無足"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0559a01","n":"0559a","t":"如是而既知如是觀因果禪愛"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0559b01","n":"0559b","t":"彼餘法若是有情皆寂靜彼他"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0559c01","n":"0559c","t":"彼主何最上彼亦自無定善惡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0560a01","n":"0560a","t":"為食不淨食而有於因果愛無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0560b01","n":"0560b","t":"知行空不實喻夢喻芭蕉分別"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0560c01","n":"0560c","t":"見如是自利而受於此苦無老"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0561a01","n":"0561a","t":"以我善力故令得天宮殿彼光"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0561b01","n":"0561b","t":"無力而得力愛心互相施安樂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0561c01","n":"0561c","t":"光明於虛空說法聲不住諸有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T32n1662_p0562a01","n":"0562a","t":"文殊師利住我若以彼位隨力"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T32n1662-菩提行經","source":"CBETA T32n1662 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":55,"unit":"T32 頁欄"}